{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm Lloid, a solo developer, and this game was a little passion project I built in my spare time.<br>You're <strong>alone</strong> in an <strong>abandoned mine</strong>, armed with nothing but a <strong>pickaxe</strong>.<br><br><strong>Mine</strong> through rocks, uncover <strong>rare minerals</strong>, <strong>sell</strong> what you find, and <strong>upgrade your gear</strong>... if you <strong>survive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the <strong>darker</strong> it gets.<br>Strange things <strong>dwell below the surface</strong>\u2014and they don't like visitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine. Progress. Fight.</strong> Discover what's <strong>buried in the dark</strong>.<br><strong>No timer. No mercy.</strong> Just you, your <strong>headlamp</strong>, and the <strong>unknown</strong>.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3753910/1358f2b5872a71c10cc664aa99375abf3df4a740.jpg"},{"name":"Caveman Certified","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3753910/816a7ee19f6d0fd16395a0d7ced6f9b8615c2473.jpg"},{"name":"I Like Rocks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3753910/b7ec89b4d6b44c8e7f100be668af56a6480dd3e7.jpg"},{"name":"Shiny Things!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3753910/05328cc51233eb27ec039efda44819dd17c79d79.jpg"},{"name":"Nope!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3753910/6a574a3c9297462475dda84d53bfde072e643106.jpg"},{"name":"Explosions Solve Everything","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3753910/218c48ad8ae1bb8de90e8c70f266f8dc2b78e6d4.jpg"},{"name":"Cart Life Chose Me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/